	<dc:title xml:lang="en-US">CITRA DIRI KARTUN INDONESIA Kajian Ilustrasi Grafis pada Garis Wajah Kartun dengan Wayang</dc:title>
	<dc:creator>Zacky, Asnar</dc:creator>
	<dc:subject xml:lang="en-US">seni murni, grafis, kriya seni, interior, desain komunikasi visual</dc:subject>
	<dc:subject xml:lang="en-US">seni rupa, desain</dc:subject>
	<dc:description xml:lang="en-US">It has to be admitted that there is an amazing similarity between the line o f Western Cartoon andWayang Purwa. It is recommended that this universality o f cartoon is used as a feedback to present and tostrengthen the self image o f the Indonesia cartoon.It is urgent to be done immediately before the irony, when the Western people and the Japaneseexplored and developed their cartoon by using inspirations that utterly rooted m Indonesian culture,happens again.Deep awareness o f and full attention given by Indonesian cartoonists to put the root o f Indonesianculture forzvard when they do their creative process is absolutely needed.Keywords: cartoon image, cartoonists’ attention, Indonesian culture root</dc:description>
